git add .
git commit -m "Internal usage logging: download + preview events from both generators are POSTed fire-and-forget to /api/log-event, which forwards them (server-enriched with Referer + User-Agent) to an Apps Script web app that appends rows to a Google Sheet (3 tabs: previews, pivot-cup-downloads, riser-pad-downloads). Per-tab UUID via sessionStorage tags every event so 'one person previewing 30 times' and 'thirty people previewing once' are distinguishable. Webhook URL lives in Render env var LOG_WEBHOOK_URL (not in git); when unset the endpoint silently drops, which is the local-dev path. New shared.js helpers LT.sessionId + LT.logEvent. Adds requests to requirements.txt. No user-visible behavior change; failures swallowed so logging plumbing can never break a download."
git push origin main
